  friction  0.6, spinning 0.001, rolling 0.0002
  colour    orange
  moves     freely
  sits      on floor, 0 m along, 0 m to the left
  launched  2.5 m/s along
  spins     62.5 rad/s about y

ball2
  is a      sphere 4 cm radius, 150 g
  rolls
  bounce    lively
  friction  0.6, spinning 0.001, rolling 0.0002
  colour    white
